{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34414","headline":"奉和袭美寄题罗浮轩辕先生所居 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美寄题罗浮轩辕先生所居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"鼎成仙驭入崆峒，百世犹传至道风。\n暂应青词爲穴凤，却思丹徼伴冥鸿。\n金公的的生炉际，琼刃时时到梦中。\n预恐浮山归有日，载将云室十洲东。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34414.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34414","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}